    "title" : "3 Croix Greens Millwater - Niseko Real Estate Photographer",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730269658729\" id=\"item-6721c8d457081826e83cf939\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-3ce0e98a5c6c5d198b69\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us</strong>: </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> 3 spacious bedrooms designed to maximize comfort and style, complete with ample natural lighting and tranquil views, ensuring a peaceful retreat from the busy world outside.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> 2 beautifully designed bathrooms featuring contemporary fixtures and finishes, including a master bath with sophisticated accents and a deep soaking tub for ultimate relaxation.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Room:</strong> A generously sized living room with elegant detailing, plush carpeting, and large windows that create a bright and inviting atmosphere. This space is ideal for both relaxing family nights and lively gatherings.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen:</strong> A modern kitchen equipped with high-end appliances, sleek cabinetry, and a functional layout that includes a spacious dining area. The kitchen's open-plan design facilitates a smooth flow into the living areas, perfect for entertaining.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Garage:</strong> The property includes a convenient single-car garage, providing secure parking and additional storage solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living:</strong> Landscaped grounds that blend seamlessly with the natural surroundings, including a private deck perfect for enjoying the outdoors and taking in the panoramic views of Milwater Estate. </p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Constructed with attention to detail and high-quality materials, 3 Croix Greens Millwater offers an exceptional living experience. Whether you're seeking a family home or a luxurious retreat, this property provides the perfect combination of comfort, style, and functionality in Millwater Estate, Auckland. </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspect-ratio&quot;:&quot;square&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;6721cf31906bcd7701047d07&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;lightbox&quot;:false,&quot;padding&quot;:20,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;thumbnails-per-row&quot;:4,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;6721cf31906bcd7701047d07&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730258888192_330207\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"6721cfa54411b3768cc37f0a\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730269113183-0T1P1TJAA63WHUALDLYJ/3+Croix+Greens+Millwater+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%281%29.jpg\" alt=\"3 Croix Greens Millwater Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (1).jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-stacked\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730269113183-0T1P1TJAA63WHUALDLYJ/3+Croix+Greens+Millwater+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%281%29.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730269113183-0T1P1TJAA63WHUALDLYJ/3+Croix+Greens+Millwater+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%281%29.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"4000x2670\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"3 Croix Greens Millwater Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (1).jpg\" data-load=\"false\" data-image-id=\"6721cfa54411b3768cc37f0a\" data-type=\"image\" />\n            \n          </div>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"6721cf8c54ea776ad489178f\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730269091856-FSGYFW0FDQQX71168O1Z/3+Croix+Greens+Millwater+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokka